# BaytMiftah Realtime Contextual Messaging & Agentic AI Engine

## 1. Executive Summary

We have designed, built, and fully verified the **BaytMiftah Realtime Contextual Messaging System** and **AI Intent → Action Engine**, directly connecting natural language communications with REOS ERP operational workflows (Maintenance Tickets, Leases, Payments, Sales, and Contractor Dispatch).

---

## 2. Key Components Built

### 1. Database Schema & Realtime Setup
- **[2026081908_realtime_contextual_messaging.sql](file:///e:/New%20folder/Propertyhub_2.0/supabase/migrations/2026081908_realtime_contextual_messaging.sql)**:
  - `conversations`: Stores contextual FKs (`property_id`, `unit_id`, `listing_id`, `lease_id`, `maintenance_issue_id`, `work_order_id`).
  - `conversation_participants`: Multi-party roles (`buyer`, `tenant`, `resident`, `landlord`, `agent`, `contractor`, `support`, `admin`).
  - `messages`: Realtime message payloads with rich types (`property_card`, `lease_card`, `maintenance_card`, `action_request`).
  - `fcm_device_tokens`: Web, Android, and iOS push notification tokens.
  - Strict Row Level Security (RLS) policies and Supabase Realtime publication.

### 2. Core Operational Services
- **[realtime-messaging.service.ts](file:///e:/New%20folder/Propertyhub_2.0/src/lib/realtime-messaging.service.ts)**:
  - Supabase Realtime Broadcast & Presence (ephemeral typing indicators, reactions, read receipts, sub-50ms latency).
  - Durable Postgres message history and automatic offline fallback caches.
- **[ai-intent-action-engine.service.ts](file:///e:/New%20folder/Propertyhub_2.0/src/lib/ai-intent-action-engine.service.ts)**:
  - **High Confidence Intent Detection**: Parses natural messages (e.g. *"The water has stopped flowing in my apartment"*) → automatically creates categorized ERP tickets with assigned SLA and department routing.
  - **Multi-Issue Extraction**: Extracts compound messages (e.g. *"The tap is leaking, bedroom light doesn't work, and AC is not cooling"*) into distinct linked tickets (Plumbing, Electrical, HVAC).
  - **Clarification on Ambiguity**: For medium-confidence inputs (e.g. *"Something is wrong with the bathroom"*), generates clarifying questions without blindly creating duplicate tickets.
  - **Recurrence Detection**: Checks past conversation ticket history (e.g. *"The leak is back"*) and prompts to reopen previous closed tickets.
- **[fcm-push.service.ts](file:///e:/New%20folder/Propertyhub_2.0/src/lib/fcm-push.service.ts)** & **[omnichannel-router.service.ts](file:///e:/New%20folder/Propertyhub_2.0/src/lib/omnichannel-router.service.ts)**:
  - Dynamic channel fallback: In-App Broadcast → FCM Push Notifications → SMS Gateway alerts.

